- DataCard: Flexible data presentation without business logic
- DataTable: Reusable table logic with sorting/selection

### Reusability
- All components use TypeScript generics where applicable
- Callback props support custom behavior
- Props interfaces use 'readonly' for immutability
- Full support for i18n and theming

### Performance
- useCallback hooks prevent unnecessary re-renders
- useMemo for expensive computations
- Proper dependency arrays
- No inline object literals in render

